        "explanation": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/db/nigeria/exam_image/editor_images/WAEC/Mathematics/2003/scan0256 (2).jpg\" style=\"height:384px; width:400px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(d) /PM/ = 9.7 cm.</p>",
